(c) the number and details of such harassment cases registered during last year?

(a) which new Institutes of Eminence have been allocated for the States of Rajasthan and West Bengal;
(b) the reason why there is not a single premier medical institute of national importance in several States of the country; and
(c) the reasons why there is no single Central University of national importance in West Bengal till date?

(a) the timeline of implementation of the Ayushman Bharat Scheme;
(b) the details of fund allocation under the scheme;
(c) the break-up of fund allocation under different procedures covered under the scheme;
(d) the deadline by when the scheme would cover 100 percent population of the country; and
