(a) the details of GST levied on agriculture related products and tools;
(b) whether Government has any plan to provide subsidies to poor and marginal farmers to purchase agricultural tools and associated products with high GST rates; and
(c) if not, the reasons therefor?

(a) the steps Government has taken for desiltation of rivers in the country;
(b) whether Government is planning for desiltation of rivers Damodar and Ganga/Hooghly or not;
(c) the steps Government has taken for desiltation of the flood prone West Bengal; and
