(a) whether WTO`s G-22 Group comprising of large developing countries like India, Brazil, China, etc. converge on a well defined modality which could be effectively taken up and forcefully negotiated to get desired results which earlier WTO meetings in Doha rounds have failed to produce;
(b) if so, what are the perceptible outcomes with regard to safety of interests of farmers in developing countries; and
